& [InvocationFault]
  + the first closure wrapper incorrectly passed EvidenceRoot to the adversarial evidence test script which accepts only PackageRoot; the script refused the unknown parameter before changing test state
  + corrected wrapper runs the adversarial test with PackageRoot and invokes the independent verifier separately with the tracked EvidenceRoot

& [PortabilityFault]
  + PowerShell7 parsed ISO8601 JSON timestamps into DateTime and normalized equivalent fractional precision while WindowsPowerShell5.1 retained strings and refused preflight .69702Z versus receipt .6970200Z
  + both strings name the same UTC instant and every other provider identity field was exact; this is verifier representation drift rather than host-state drift

& [Correction]
  + preserve exact provider field order and compare creation_utc as a parseable zero-offset DateTimeOffset UTC tick value while comparing all seven other fields exactly
  + add one equivalent-precision acceptance and one different-moment refusal to the provider-free adversarial test

& [Boundary]
  + no receipt or live evidence byte is rewritten and no remote state is consulted or changed by the correction
